      "Text": "Security update for rrdtool",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for rrdtool fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-43958: stack buffer overflow in `rrdcached` `handle_request_create()` can lead to local privilege escalation\n  via unbounded DS/RRA arguments (bsc#1267243).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
